4. High Performance Sync(gRPC)
Instead of HTTP + JSON it uses binary + contract  
- Service A -> gRPC call -> Service B -> response -> Continue
- Faster and more efficient

Flow for using gRPC
- Define Contract
- Generate client/Server code
- Call like a normal function
e.g.
user = stub.GetUser(UserRequest(id=123))
Feels like local function call but its remote.

